sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Visitor
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>LoginPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>LoginBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>LoginController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: log in
  UI->>B: POST /api/auth/login (JWT)
  B->>C: login(LoginRequest request)
  alt wrong password / suspended
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 401 / 403 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: findByEmail()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: LoginResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end